{"page":358,"verses":[{"verse_key":"24:59","surah":24,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا بَلَغَ ٱلْأَطْفَـٰلُ مِنكُمُ ٱلْحُلُمَ فَلْيَسْتَـْٔذِنُوا۟ كَمَا ٱسْتَـْٔذَنَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ يُبَيِّنُ ٱللَّهُ لَكُمْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌ حَكِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When your children reach puberty, they should [always] ask your permission to enter, like their elders do. This is how God makes His messages clear to you: God is all knowing, all wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَلَغَ","en_gloss":"reach","transliteration":"balagha","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْأَطْفَـٰلُ","en_gloss":"the children","transliteration":"l-aṭfālu","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنكُمُ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkumu","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْحُلُمَ","en_gloss":"the puberty","transliteration":"l-ḥuluma","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَلْيَسْتَـْٔذِنُوا۟","en_gloss":"then let them ask permission","transliteration":"falyastadhinū","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱسْتَـْٔذَنَ","en_gloss":"asked permission","transliteration":"is'tadhana","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"qablihim","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يُبَيِّنُ","en_gloss":"Allah makes clear","transliteration":"yubayyinu","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah makes clear","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"His Verses","transliteration":"āyātihi","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":18,"ar":"عَلِيمٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":19,"ar":"حَكِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","verse_key":"24:59"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٥٩","en_gloss":"(59)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:59"}]},{"verse_key":"24:60","surah":24,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلْقَوَٰعِدُ مِنَ ٱلنِّسَآءِ ٱلَّـٰتِى لَا يَرْجُونَ نِكَاحًا فَلَيْسَ عَلَيْهِنَّ جُنَاحٌ أَن يَضَعْنَ ثِيَابَهُنَّ غَيْرَ مُتَبَرِّجَـٰتٍۭ بِزِينَةٍ ۖ وَأَن يَسْتَعْفِفْنَ خَيْرٌ لَّهُنَّ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ سَمِيعٌ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"No blame will be attached to elderly women who are not hoping for sex, if they take off their outer garments without flaunting their charms, but it is preferable for them not to do this: God is all hearing, all seeing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلْقَوَٰعِدُ","en_gloss":"And postmenopausal","transliteration":"wal-qawāʿidu","verse_key":"24:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"24:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنِّسَآءِ","en_gloss":"the women","transliteration":"l-nisāi","verse_key":"24:60"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّـٰتِى","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"allātī","verse_key":"24:60"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"24:60"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَرْجُونَ","en_gloss":"have desire","transliteration":"yarjūna","verse_key":"24:60"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نِكَاحًۭا","en_gloss":"(for) marriage","transliteration":"nikāḥan","verse_key":"24:60"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَلَيْسَ","en_gloss":"then not is","transliteration":"falaysa","verse_key":"24:60"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْهِنَّ","en_gloss":"on them","transliteration":"ʿalayhinna","verse_key":"24:60"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جُنَاحٌ","en_gloss":"any blame","transliteration":"junā